NEW** Full competitor analysis\\n\\n## Test Plan\\n\\n- [ ] Verify homepage loads with new content structure\\n- [ ] Check `/rss.xml` generates valid RSS feed\\n- [ ] Verify skip-to-content link works on focus\\n- [ ] Test blog page shows Popular Posts section\\n- [ ] Validate structured data with Google Rich Results Test\\n- [ ] Check robots.txt is accessible\",\"state\":\"open\",\"draft\":false,\"merged\":false,\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan/pull/1\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"sameerkhansf\",\"id\":101021315,\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/sameerkhansf\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101021315?v=4\"},\"head\":{\"ref\":\"competitor-seo\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan\",\"description\":\"Personal Website Reumse\"}},\"base\":{\"ref\":\"main\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan\",\"description\":\"Personal Website Reumse\"}},\"created_at\":\"2025-12-16T02:23:36Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-16T02:23:40Z\"}]"}],"resultType":"complete"}}
