ctured data with Google Rich Results Test\n- [ ] Check robots.txt is accessible","created_at":"2025-12-16T02:23:36Z","draft":false,"head":{"ref":"competitor-seo","repo":{"description":"Personal Website Reumse","full_name":"sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan"},"sha":"[REDACTED]"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sameerkhansf/Sameer-Khan/pull/1","merged":false,"number":1,"state":"open","title":"feat: Comprehensive SEO improvements based on competitor analysis","updated_at":"2025-12-16T02:23:40Z","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101021315?v=4","id":101021315,"login":"sameerkhansf","profile_url":"https://github.com/sameerkhansf"}}]
