[2026-08-26T09:22:08.105Z] [DEBUG] [rpc] github←resp 8539b {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","src":"data:image/png;base64,","theme":"light"},{"mimeType":"image/png","src":"data:image/png;base64,","theme":"dark"}],"name":"github-mcp-server","title":"GitHub MCP Server","version":"v1.9.0"}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"total_count\":2699264,\"incomplete_results\":false,\"items\":[{\"name\":\"ai.md\",\"path\":\"ai.md\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repository\":\"laravel/docs\",\"text_matches\":[{\"object_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repositories/7546847/contents/ai.md?ref=[REDACTED]\",\"object_type\":\"FileContent\",\"property\":\"content\",\"fragment\":\"\\u003ca name=\\\"laravel-boost\\\"\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\n## Laravel Boost\\n\\n[Laravel Boost](https://github.com/laravel/boost) bridges the gap between AI coding agents and your Laravel application. Boost is an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server equipped with over 15 specialized tools that provide AI agents with deep insight into your application's structure, database, routes, and more. When you install Boost, your AI agent transforms from a general-purpose code assistant into a Laravel expert that understands your specific application.\\n\\nBoost provides three major capabilities: a suite of MCP tools for inspecting and interacting with your application, composable AI guidelines crafted specifically for the Laravel ecosystem, and a powerful documentation API containing over 17,000 pieces of Laravel-specific knowledge.\\n\",\"matches\":[{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[121,123]},{\"text\":\"coding\",\"indices\":[124,130]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[269,271]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[389,391]},{\"text\":\"assistant\",\"indices\":[437,446]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[641,643]},{\"text\":\"ai\",\"indices\":[740,742]}]}]},{\"name\":\"AI.md\",\"path\":\"AI.md\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repository\":\"killop/anything_about_game\",\"text_matches\":[{\"object_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repositories/243201359/contents/AI.md?ref=[REDACTED]\",\"object_type\":\"FileContent\",\"property\":\"content\",\"fragment\":\"- https://github.com/YGYOOO/WorldX 一句话生成一个AI自主驱动的世界.\\n- https://github.com/leigest519/OpenGame OpenGame: Open Agentic Coding for Games\\n- [GOD](https://github.com/XiaoLuoLYG/GOD) Govern, Observe, Direct - a real-time control room for agent societies\\n- [FreeUltraCode] https://github.com/wellingfeng/FreeUltraCode FreeUltraCode - AI coding agent for game development: engine workflows, gameplay code, and asset generation.\\n- [godogen](https://github.com/htdt/godogen) Autonomous game development for Godot, Bevy, and Babylon.js with Claude Code and Codex.\\n- [GameDesignOS](https://github.com/DY-2026/GameDesignOS) Local-first OS for AI-assisted game design: turn AI-agent sessions into decisions, evidence, experiments, proposals, and durable project memory.\\n\",\"matches\":[{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[56,58]},{\"text\":\"Coding\",\"indices\":[145,151]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[355,357]},{\"text\":\"coding\",\"indices\":[358,364]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[658,660]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[688,690]}]}]},{\"name\":\"ai.md\",\"path\":\"ai.md\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repository\":\"costinEEST/almanacs\",\"text_matches\":[{\"object_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repositories/228037152/contents/ai.md?ref=[REDACTED]\",\"object_type\":\"FileContent\",\"property\":\"content\",\"fragment\":\"- [Use ChatGPT from the terminal](https://github.com/gmpetrov/openai-chatgpt)\\n- [GPT in 60 Lines of NumPy](https://jaykmody.com/blog/gpt-from-scratch) + https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=34726115\\n- https://github.com/Zero6992/chatGPT-discord-bot\\n- https://www.manning.com/books/regular-expression-puzzles-and-ai-coding-assistants\\n- https://writings.stephenwolfram.com/2023/02/what-is-chatgpt-doing-and-why-does-it-work\\n- [Open Assistant: Conversational AI for Everyone](https: