g_about_game\",\"text_matches\":[{\"object_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repositories/243201359/contents/AI.md?ref=[REDACTED]\",\"object_type\":\"FileContent\",\"property\":\"content\",\"fragment\":\"- https://github.com/YGYOOO/WorldX 一句话生成一个AI自主驱动的世界.\\n- https://github.com/leigest519/OpenGame OpenGame: Open Agentic Coding for Games\\n- [GOD](https://github.com/XiaoLuoLYG/GOD) Govern, Observe, Direct - a real-time control room for agent societies\\n- [FreeUltraCode] https://github.com/wellingfeng/FreeUltraCode FreeUltraCode - AI coding agent for game development: engine workflows, gameplay code, and asset generation.\\n- [godogen](https://github.com/htdt/godogen) Autonomous game development for Godot, Bevy, and Babylon.js with Claude Code and Codex.\\n- [GameDesignOS](https://github.com/DY-2026/GameDesignOS) Local-first OS for AI-assisted game design: turn AI-agent sessions into decisions, evidence, experiments, proposals, and durable project memory.\\n\",\"matches\":[{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[56,58]},{\"text\":\"Coding\",\"indices\":[145,151]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[355,357]},{\"text\":\"coding\",\"indices\":[358,364]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[658,660]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[688,690]}]}]},{\"name\":\"ai.md\",\"path\":\"ai.md\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repository\":\"costinEEST/almanacs\",\"text_matches\":[{\"object_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repositories/228037152/contents/ai.md?ref=[REDACTED]\",\"object_type\":\"FileContent\",\"property\":\"content\",\"fragment\":\"- [Use ChatGPT from the terminal](https://github.com/gmpetrov/openai-chatgpt)\\n- [GPT in 60 Lines of NumPy](https://jaykmody.com/blog/gpt-from-scratch) + https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=34726115\\n- https://github.com/Zero6992/chatGPT-discord-bot\\n- https://www.manning.com/books/regular-expression-puzzles-and-ai-coding-assistants\\n- https://writings.stephenwolfram.com/2023/02/what-is-chatgpt-doing-and-why-does-it-work\\n- [Open Assistant: Conversational AI for Everyone](https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=34654809) + https://github.com/LAION-AI/Open-Assistant\\n- https://github.com/ai-forever/ru-gpts\",\"matches\":[{\"text\":\"ai\",\"indices\":[66,68]},{\"text\":\"ai\",\"indices\":[312,314]},{\"text\":\"coding\",\"indices\":[315,321]},{\"text\":\"assistant\",\"indices\":[322,331]},{\"text\":\"Assistant\",\"indices\":[430,439]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[456,458]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[542,544]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[547,549]},{\"text\":\"Assistant\",\"indices\":[555,564]},{\"text\":\"ai\",\"indices\":[586,588]}]}]},{\"name\":\"AI.md\",\"path\":\"AI.md\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repository\":\"RMeli/spyrmsd\",\"text_matches\":[{\"object_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repositories/214157073/contents/AI.md?ref=[REDACTED]\",\"object_type\":\"FileContent\",\"property\":\"content\",\"fragment\":\"# AI Coding Assistants\\n\\nThis document provides guidance for AI tools and developers using AI assistance when contributing to `spyrmsd`.\\n\\nAI tools helping with `spyrmsd` development should follow the standard development process.\\n\\n## Licensing and Legal Requirements\",\"matches\":[{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[2,4]},{\"text\":\"Coding\",\"indices\":[5,11]},{\"text\":\"Assistant\",\"indices\":[12,21]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[60,62]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[90,92]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[137,139]}]}]},{\"name\":\"AI.md\",\"path\":\"AI.md\",\"sha\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"repository\":\"devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid\",\"text_matches\":[{\"object_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repositories/324788861/contents/AI.md?ref=[REDACTED]\",\"object_type\":\"FileContent\",\"property\":\"content\",\"fragment\":\"\\n## 🤖 How AI is Accepted \\u0026 Encouraged\\n\\nAI coding assistants (such as Antigravity, GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, etc.) are fully accepted and welcomed for contributing to this repository.\\n\\n### Ideal Use Cases for AI in This Project:\\n* **Generating Boilerplate Code**: Creating Jetpack Compose components, data models, or standard helper functions.\",\"matches\":[{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[13,15]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[42,44]},{\"text\":\"coding\",\"indices\":[45,51]},{\"text\":\"assistant\",\"indices\":[52,61]},{\"text\":\"AI\",\"indices\":[234,236]}]}]}]}","type":"text"}],"resultType":"complete"}]
